<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Prosure listing to be terminated Friday.</title>
<headline>Prosure listing to be terminated Friday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The listing of shares in Protea Assurance Co Ltd (Prosure) on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange would be terminated from the close of business on Friday, the company said.</p>
<p>The move follows Mutual and Federal Insurance Co Ltd's acquisition of Prosure shares that had not already been bought by them by November 21, it said in a published announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
